<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RMB says in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>RMB says in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>RMB Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it was in talks, which if successfully concluded could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution when dealing in RMB shares.</p>
<p>A further announcement would be made in due course, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
